Package: u-boot-mixtile-blade3
Architecture: arm64
Provides: u-boot
Conflicts: u-boot
Replaces: u-boot
Description: U-Boot bootloader for Mixtile Blade 3
 Radxa vendor U-Boot (Rockchip RK3588) built for the Mixtile Blade 3, with the
 Mixtile board device tree and power-delivery/MAC patches. The FIT generator
 assembles U-Boot proper with the BL31 (ATF) blob into u-boot.itb, and mkimage
 wraps the DDR init blob with SPL into idbloader.img -- the two files written
 to the boot device at LBA 64 and LBA 16384.

